unit type length
unit type mass
unit type time
unit type angle
unit type temperature


unit meter: length
unit m is meter

unit foot: length
unit ft is foot

unit cm = m / 100
unit mm = m / 1000
unit km = 1000 * m

unit inch = foot / 12
unit yard = 3 * foot
unit mile = 5280 * foot

unit m = 3.28084 * ft


unit kilogram: mass
unit kg is kilogram

unit gram = kg / 1000
unit mg = gram / 1000


unit second: time
unit s is second

unit minute = 60 * second
unit hour = 60 * minute
unit day = 24 * hour


unit degrees: angle
unit radians = 3.14159265358979 * degrees / 180
unit turn = 360 * degrees


unit kelvin: temperature
unit celsius = kelvin - 273.15
unit fahrenheit = 9 * celsius / 5 + 32


unit newton is kg m / s^2
unit joule is newton m
unit watt is joule / s
unit calorie = 4.184 * joule
unit btu = 1055 * joule
